  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 50 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^22 + x^23 + x^27 + x^28, b(x) = x^14 + x^21 + x^29 + x^36 in F_2[x]/(x^50 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^50 - 1)",
